          "meaning": "demons, cannot, trounce.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.21.10",
      "label": "1.21.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "एष विग्रहवान् धर्म एष वीर्यवतां वरः |\nएष बुद्ध्याधिको लोके तपसश्च परायणम्",
      "iast": "eṣa vigrahavān dharma eṣa vīryavatām varaḥ |\neṣa vidya adhiko loke tapasaḥ ca parāyaṇam",
      "translation": "\"He is an embodiment of virtue, matchless among the venturesome, peerless in intellect among all in the world, and flawless in ascesis.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "eSa vigrahavaan dharmaH",
          "iast": "eṣa vigrahavān dharmaḥ",
          "devanagari": "एष विग्रहवान् धर्मः",
          "meaning": "he is [Vishvamitra is,] an embodiment of, virtue",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "eSa viiryavataam varaH",
          "iast": "eṣa vīryavatām varaḥ",
          "devanagari": "एष वीर्यवतां वरः",
          "meaning": "he is, among venturesome, matchless",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 3
        },
        {
          "itrans": "eSa budhyaa",
          "iast": "eṣa budhyā",
          "devanagari": "एष बुध्या",
          "meaning": "he is, by intellect",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "loke adhikaH",
          "iast": "loke adhikaḥ",
          "devanagari": "लोके अधिकः",
          "meaning": "[among all] in world, peerless",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 8
        },
        {
          "itrans": "tapasaH paraayaNam",
          "iast": "tapasaḥ parāyaṇam",
          "devanagari": "तपसः परायणं",
          "meaning": "for ascesis, flawless one.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.21.11",
      "label": "1.21.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "एषोऽस्त्रान् विविधान् वेत्ति त्रैलोक्ये सचराचरे |\nनैनमन्यः पुमान् वेत्ति न च वेत्स्यन्ति केचन",
      "iast": "eṣo astrān vividhān vetti trailokye sa carācare |\nna enam anyaḥ pumān vetti na ca vetsyanti kecana",
      "translation": "\"He is in the know-how of various missiles, and no other person is there in the triad of worlds, inclusive of sessile and mobile worlds, who is knowledgeable about him, or someone who can know him will be there in future, excepting myself.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "eSa vividhaan astraan vetti",
          "iast": "eṣa vividhān astrān vetti",
          "devanagari": "एष विविधान् अस्त्रान् वेत्ति",
          "meaning": "he, various, missiles, is in know-how",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "enam",
          "iast": "enam",
          "devanagari": "एनं",
          "meaning": "him [about Vishvamitra]",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 8
        },
        {
          "itrans": "sa chara a chara",
          "iast": "sa cara a cara",
          "devanagari": "स चर अ चर",
          "meaning": "with, mobile, sessile",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "trai lokye",
          "iast": "trai lokye",
          "devanagari": "त्रै लोक्ये",
          "meaning": "in three, worlds",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 4
        },
        {
          "itrans": "anyaH pumaan na vetti",
          "iast": "anyaḥ pumān na vetti",
          "devanagari": "अन्यः पुमान् न वेत्ति",
          "meaning": "other, person, doest not, know [excepting me]",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 7
        },
        {
          "itrans": "kechana na vetsyanti cha",
          "iast": "kecana na vetsyanti ca",
          "devanagari": "केचन न वेत्स्यन्ति च",
          "meaning": "someone, not, [be able to] know, even.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.21.12",
      "label": "1.21.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "न देवा नर्षयः केचिन्नामरा न च राक्षसाः |\nगन्धर्वयक्षप्रवराः सकिन्नरमहोरगाः",
      "iast": "na devā na ṛṣayaḥ ke cit na amarā na ca rākṣasāḥ |\ngandharva yakṣa pravarāḥ sa kinnara mahoragāḥ",
      "translation": "\"While Gods cannot know Vishvamitra, can anybody from sages - no; immortals- no; demons - no; the gandharva-s and eminent yaksha-s together with the kinnaraa-s and great reptile beings - no, they cannot know him.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "devaaH",
          "iast": "devāḥ",
          "devanagari": "देवाः",
          "meaning": "gods",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "itrans": "na",
          "iast": "na",
          "devanagari": "न",
          "meaning": "cannot know Vishvamitra",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "itrans": "R^ishaSayaH kechit na",
          "iast": "ṛśaṣayaḥ kecit na",
          "devanagari": "ऋशषयः केचित् न",
          "meaning": "sages, anybody, no",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "amaraaH na",
          "iast": "amarāḥ na",
          "devanagari": "अमराः न",
          "meaning": "immortals, no",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 6
        },
        {
          "itrans": "raakshasaaH cha",
          "iast": "rākśasāḥ ca",
          "devanagari": "राक्शसाः च",
          "meaning": "demons, also",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 9
        },
        {
          "itrans": "na",
          "iast": "na",
          "devanagari": "न",
          "meaning": "no",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 8
        },
        {
          "itrans": "sa kinnara maha uragaaH ghandharva yaksha pravaraaH",
          "iast": "sa kinnara maha uragāḥ ghandharva yakśa pravarāḥ",
          "devanagari": "स किन्नर मह उरगाः घन्धर्व यक्श प्रवराः",
          "meaning": "together with, kinnaraa, great reptile beings, gandharva, yaksha, eminent ones",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "[na",
          "iast": "[na",
          "devanagari": "[न",
          "meaning": "no.]",
          "anvayaIndex": 7,
          "verseIndex": 0
        }
      ]
