      "devanagari": "तेनास्य मुनिमुख्यस्य धर्मज्ञस्य महात्मनः |\nन किंचिदस्त्यविदितं भूतं भव्यं च राघव",
      "iast": "tena asya muni mukhyasya dharmajñasya mahātmanaḥ |\nna kiñcid asti aviditam bhūtam bhavyam ca rāghava",
      "translation": "\"Thereby, oh, Raghava, nothing whatsoever is unknown to this great-souled Vishvamitra, who is a distinguished sage and the knower of virtue, either that has happened or that is happening.",
